#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the expired Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Ṣé ó dá ọ lójú pé o fẹ́ pa àwọn èsì Port sí MAC sí IP tó ti parí rẹ́ báyìí?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Ṣé o dá ọ lójú pé o fẹ́ nu àwọn iṣẹ́ àyẹ̀wò Mactrack tí a fi pamọ́ sínú káṣì kúrò?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Ṣé ó dá ọ lójú pé o fẹ́ pa gbogbo àwọn èsì Aggregated Port sí MAC sí IP rẹ́ kúrò nínú ètò náà?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Ṣé ó dá ọ lójú pé o fẹ́ pa rẹ́ kí o sì tún gbogbo àwọn èsì Aggregated Port sí MAC sí IP ṣe nínú ètò náà?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "Ṣé ó dá ọ lójú pé o fẹ́ ṣe ìgbàsílẹ̀ kí o sì gbé ibi ìpamọ́ dátà IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI wọlé báyìí?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Ṣé o dá ọ lójú pé o fẹ́ tún àkójọ ọjọ́ àyẹ̀wò kọ́ láti inú àwọn èsì Port sí MAC sí IP tí a tọ́jú báyìí?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Tún kọ́ kí o sì ṣe àgbéyẹ̀wò ìpín tí ó ní àkíyèsí èbúté tuntun jùlọ, èyí tí í ṣe ọ̀sẹ̀ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ pẹ̀lú àwọn ìpín ọ̀sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀. A ó mú kí tábìlì tí kò ní ìpín ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa pátápátá. A ó fò àwọn àyẹ̀wò tí a ṣètò nígbà tí èyí bá ń ṣiṣẹ́. Tẹ̀síwájú?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Ṣe ìtọ́jú yìí ní àkókò tí a kò fi ń ṣiṣẹ́ púpọ̀. Àtúnkọ náà ń ṣe àdàkọ gbogbo ìtàn àwọn tábìlì ibùdó (àdírẹ́sì MAC), àdírẹ́sì IP àti 802.1x lọ́kọ̀ọ̀kan, ó sì lè gba ọ̀pọ̀ wákàtí. A ó fò àwọn àyẹ̀wò tí a ṣètò sílẹ̀, ìtọ́jú ibi ìpamọ́ dátà yóò dúró, àti pé wíwá MAC, IP àti 802.1x yóò fi ìránṣẹ́ ìtọ́jú hàn títí yóò fi parí. Fún ààyè sílẹ̀ lórí díísìkì fún ẹ̀dà kejì ti tábìlì kọ̀ọ̀kan àti àwọn àtọ́ka rẹ̀. Tẹ̀síwájú?"

