#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Database Administration"
msgstr "Ìṣàkóso Dátàbẹ́ẹ̀sì"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes expired Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Only records that have expired, based upon your criteria are removed."
msgstr "Máa ń pa àwọn ìsopọ̀ Pọ́ọ̀tì sí MAC sí IP tí àkókò wọn ti parí rẹ́ kúrò nínú ibùdó ìpamọ́ dátà.  Àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ tí àkókò wọn ti parí nìkan, ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú àwọn ìlànà rẹ, ni a ó yọ kúrò."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Refresh IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI Database"
msgstr "Sọ Ibùdó Dátà MAC/OUI Olùtajà IEEE Di Ọ̀tun"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This function will download and install the latest OIU database from the IEEE Website.  Each Network Interface Card (NIC) has a MAC Address.  The MAC Address can be broken into two parts.  The first part of the MAC Address contains the Vendor MAC.  The Vendor MAC identifies who manufactured the part.  This will be helpful in spot checking for rogue devices on your network."
msgstr "Iṣẹ́ yìí yóò ṣe ìgbàsílẹ̀ yóò sì fi ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà OIU tuntun jùlọ sórí ẹ̀rọ láti Ojú-òpó Wẹ́ẹ̀bù IEEE. Káàdì Ìsopọ̀ Nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì (NIC) kọ̀ọ̀kan ní Àdírẹ́sì MAC kan. A lè pín Àdírẹ́sì MAC sí apá méjì. Apá àkọ́kọ́ ti Àdírẹ́sì MAC ní MAC Olùtajà nínú. MAC Olùtajà ń fi ẹni tó ṣe apá náà hàn. Èyí yóò wúlò fún àyẹ̀wò lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ fún àwọn ẹ̀rọ àìfọwọ́sí lórí nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì rẹ."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes old and potentially stale Mactrack scanning functions from the drop-down you receive when you edit a device type."
msgstr "Máa ń pa àwọn iṣẹ́ ìṣàyẹ̀wò Mactrack àtijọ́ àti èyí tí ó lè ti di àtijọ́ jù rẹ́ kúrò nínú àtòjọ sísọ̀kalẹ̀ tí o máa ń rí nígbà tí o bá ṣàtúnṣe irú ẹ̀rọ kan."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes <strong>ALL</strong> Port to MAC to IP associations from the database all IP Addresses, IP Ranges, and VLANS.  This utility is good when you want to start over.  <strong>DANGER: All prior data is deleted.</strong>"
msgstr "Máa ń pa <strong>GBOGBO</strong> ìsopọ̀ Pọ́ọ̀tì sí MAC sí IP rẹ́ kúrò nínú ibùdó ìpamọ́ dátà, gbogbo Àdírẹ́sì IP, Àwọn Àgbègbè IP, àti àwọn VLAN.  Ohun èlò yìí dára nígbà tí o bá fẹ́ bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti ìbẹ̀rẹ̀.  <strong>EWU: Gbogbo dátà tẹ́lẹ̀ yóò di píparẹ́.</strong>"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds the list of scan dates from the stored Port to MAC to IP results, reading each partition once. Scans and maintenance keep the list current, so this is only needed after results were removed outside of maintenance, for example by deleting devices."
msgstr "Ó ń tún kọ́ àtòjọ àwọn ọjọ́ àyẹ̀wò láti inú àwọn èsì Èbúté sí MAC sí IP tí a tọ́jú, ní kíkà ìpín kọ̀ọ̀kan lẹ́ẹ̀kan. Àwọn àyẹ̀wò àti ìtọ́jú ń pa àtòjọ náà mọ́ ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú ìgbà, nítorí náà a nílò èyí nìkan lẹ́yìn tí a bá ti yọ àwọn èsì kúrò níta ìtọ́jú, fún àpẹẹrẹ nípa pípa àwọn ẹ̀rọ rẹ́."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "View Partition Status"
msgstr "Wo Ipò Ìpín"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Shows how the Port to MAC to IP results are partitioned, the partition size in use and why, and what the last database maintenance did."
msgstr "Fi bí a ṣe pín àwọn èsì Èbúté sí MAC sí IP hàn, ìwọ̀n ìpín tí a ń lò àti ìdí rẹ̀, àti ohun tí ìtọ́jú ibùdó dátà tó kẹ́yìn ṣe."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds and analyzes only the partition containing the latest port observation to reclaim deleted space; with weekly partitions that is the current week. Unpartitioned tables are optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped until it finishes."
msgstr "Ó ń tún kọ́ kí ó sì ṣe àgbéyẹ̀wò kìkì ìpín tí ó ní àkíyèsí èbúté tuntun jùlọ láti gba ààyè tí a pa rẹ́ padà; pẹ̀lú àwọn ìpín ọ̀sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀, ìyẹn ni ọ̀sẹ̀ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́. A ó mú kí àwọn tábìlì tí kò ní ìpín ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa pátápátá. A ó fò àwọn àyẹ̀wò tí a ṣètò títí yóò fi parí."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Choose daily or weekly partitions, or disable partitioning, for the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables. The rebuild copies the full history in the background; scheduled scans are skipped and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message meanwhile."
msgstr "Yan ìpínsọ́tọ̀ ojoojúmọ́ tàbí ọ̀sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀, tàbí kí o pa ìpínsọ́tọ̀, fún àwọn tábìlì pọ́ọ̀tì (àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì MAC), àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì IP àti 802.1x. Àtúnkọ náà ń da gbogbo ìtàn kọjá ní ẹ̀yìn; a fò àwọn ìṣàyẹ̀wò tí a ṣètò sílẹ̀, àti wíwá MAC, IP àti 802.1x ń fi ìránṣẹ́ ìtọ́jú hàn lákòókò náà."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Aggregated Table Administration"
msgstr "Ìṣàkóso Tábìlì Àkójọpọ̀"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Data will again be collected on the basis of <strong>only new</strong> scanned data in the next mactrack poller run."
msgstr "Máa ń pa GBOGBO àwọn ìsopọ̀ Pọ́ọ̀tì sí MAC sí IP <strong>Tí A Kó Jọ</strong> (Kì í ṣe Àwọn Èsì Ìṣàyẹ̀wò) rẹ́ kúrò nínú ibùdó ìpamọ́ dátà.  A ó tún kó dátà jọ ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú <strong>tuntun nìkan</strong> tí a ṣàyẹ̀wò nínú ìṣiṣẹ́ olùṣàyẹ̀wò mactrack tí ó tẹ̀lé e."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database and their re-creation based on <strong>All scanned data</strong> now."
msgstr "Máa ń pa GBOGBO àwọn ìsopọ̀ Pọ́ọ̀tì sí MAC sí IP <strong>Tí A Kó Jọ</strong> (Kì í ṣe Àwọn Èsì Ìṣàyẹ̀wò) rẹ́ kúrò nínú ibùdó ìpamọ́ dátà àti títún wọn ṣẹ̀dá ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú <strong>Gbogbo dátà tí a ṣàyẹ̀wò</strong> báyìí."

